User Stories
The stories are grouped by area. Version 2 items are marked.

1. As a dispatcher, I want to upload a CSV of orders, so that I don't re-type dozens of orders a day.
2. As a dispatcher, I want each order checked for a valid phone number and a complete address before it is accepted, so that wrong numbers don't cause failed trips.
3. As a dispatcher, I want to create a single order through a short form, so that one-off orders take under a minute.
4. As a dispatcher, I want to mark an order as COD with the amount to collect, so that the system tracks the cash from the start.
5. As a dispatcher, I want duplicate orders flagged, so that I don't dispatch the same parcel twice.
6. As an operations manager, I want every order's status in one list, so that I don't chase riders by phone.
7. As a receiver, I want a WhatsApp message with my order details and Confirm, Reschedule and Cancel choices, so that I decide before a rider travels to me.
8. As a dispatcher, I want orders held until the receiver confirms, so that no trip is wasted on someone who won't be there.
9. As a receiver, I want to pick a different delivery time, so that I'm home when the rider arrives.
